        "Description": "Welcome to Bangkok \rGuests of the infamous Himmipan hotel have been hearing strange noises echoing throughout the halls in the evening, other have been claiming items from their room have been stolen while they are within their suite&apos;s.\rThere is even a report of a horse roaming the hallways which is strange as there are no pets or animals permitted on hotel property.\r\rThing&apos;s sure are strange here 47, but hay im sure you&apos;ll get to the bottom of this. \rDon&apos;t forget to wash your lucky horseshoes.",
